# Paradigm Shifts

Structured approach for handling foundational changes and paradigm shifts.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Architecture changes
- Refactoring foundational systems
- Migrating to new patterns
- Redesigning core components
- Rewriting or restructuring major systems

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 2 (J'≠0 - HALIRA Protocol)** - For foundational contradictions requiring paradigm shift.

